## How To Use Together

These two indicators are **complementary, not redundant**:

1. **NMC** tells you the momentum direction and strength
2. **PEP** tells you if that momentum has institutional backing, whether conditions are favorable, and when the regime changes

> [!TIP]
> The highest-probability trades occur when:
> - Both NMC and PEP agree on direction
> - PEP Edge Quality > 40% (patterns exist)
> - PEP Toxicity is elevated (informed traders active)
> - PEP shows no stealth activity opposing your direction
> - CUSUM hasn't recently broken against your trade

